<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Agora Community Broadcasting</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600&family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #1A1A2E; color: #E8D5B0; }

    .acb-nav {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1.25rem 2rem;
      border-bottom: 0.5px solid rgba(232,213,176,0.15);
    }
    .acb-wordmark { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #E8D5B0; }
    .acb-wordmark span { color: #C4782A; }
    .acb-nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .acb-nav-links a { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(232,213,176,0.6); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    .acb-nav-links a:hover { color: #E8D5B0; }

    .acb-hero { text-align: center; padding: 4rem 2rem 2rem; }
    .acb-eyebrow {
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #C4782A;
      text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .acb-hero-headline {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 38px; font-weight: 600;
      color: #F5F0E8; line-height: 1.2; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 1rem;
    }
    .acb-hero-sub {
      font-size: 15px; color: rgba(232,213,176,0.65);
      max-width: 460px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .acb-cta-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
    .acb-btn-primary {
      background: #C4782A; color: #1A1A2E; border: none; border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
    }
    .acb-btn-primary:hover { background: #d4882f; }
    .acb-btn-secondary {
      background: transparent; color: #E8D5B0;
      border: 0.5px solid rgba(232,213,176,0.4); border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem; cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
    }
    .acb-btn-secondary:hover { border-color: rgba(232,213,176,0.7); }

    .acb-columns-section { padding: 0 2rem 3rem; }
    .acb-columns-label {
      text-align: center; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: rgba(232,213,176,0.4); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .acb-columns-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px;
      max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .acb-column-card {
      border: 0.5px solid rgba(232,213,176,0.15); border-radius: 4px;
      overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer; transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .acb-column-card:hover { border-color: rgba(196,120,42,0.6); }
    .acb-column-card svg { width: 100%; height: 64px; display: block; }
    .acb-column-body { padding: 0.75rem 1rem 1rem; text-align: center; }
    .acb-column-name {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
      color: #F5F0E8; margin-bottom: 4px; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }
    .acb-column-desc { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(232,213,176,0.5); line-height: 1.5; }

    .acb-live-dot {
      width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C4782A;
      display: inline-block; margin-right: 6px; vertical-align: middle;
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:0.3} }
    .acb-live-label { font-size: 11px; color: #C4782A; letter-spacing: 0.1em; vertical-align: middle; }

    .acb-divider { border: none; border-top: 0.5px solid rgba(232,213,176,0.1); margin: 0 2rem; }

    .acb-two-col {
      padding: 3rem 2rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; align-items: center;
    }
    .acb-section-eyebrow { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #C4782A; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .acb-section-headline {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600;
      color: #F5F0E8; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .acb-section-body { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(232,213,176,0.6); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .acb-quote {
      border-left: 2px solid #C4782A; padding-left: 1rem;
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 12px;
      color: rgba(232,213,176,0.5); font-style: italic; line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .acb-quote-attr { margin-top: 8px; font-style: normal; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: rgba(232,213,176,0.3); }

    .acb-own-section { padding: 3rem 2rem; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .acb-own-card {
      border: 0.5px solid rgba(196,120,42,0.35); border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 2rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .acb-own-card::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; background: #C4782A;
    }
    .acb-own-tag {
      display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      background: rgba(196,120,42,0.15); color: #C4782A; border-radius: 2px;
      padding: 3px 10px; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .acb-own-headline {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;
      color: #F5F0E8; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .acb-own-body { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(232,213,176,0.6); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .acb-own-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .acb-own-option { border: 0.5px solid rgba(232,213,176,0.12); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; }
    .acb-own-option-label { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 12px; color: #F5F0E8; margin-bottom: 4px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
    .acb-own-option-desc { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(232,213,176,0.45); line-height: 1.5; }

    .acb-pp-section { padding: 2rem 2rem 3rem; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .acb-pp-bar {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      border: 0.5px solid rgba(232,213,176,0.12); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .acb-pp-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .acb-pp-icon {
      width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 4px;
      background: rgba(196,120,42,0.15); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .acb-pp-label { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(232,213,176,0.5); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
    .acb-pp-name { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 14px; color: #F5F0E8; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
    .acb-pp-desc { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(232,213,176,0.5); max-width: 260px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .acb-pp-link { font-size: 12px; color: #C4782A; text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; letter-spacing: 0.06em; white-space: nowrap; }
    .acb-pp-link:hover { color: #d4882f; }

    .acb-footer { border-top: 0.5px solid rgba(232,213,176,0.1); padding: 2rem; text-align: center; }
    .acb-footer-wordmark { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: rgba(232,213,176,0.35); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .acb-footer-sub { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(232,213,176,0.25); }
    .acb-footer-pp { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(196,120,42,0.5); margin-top: 4px; }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .acb-hero-headline { font-size: 26px; }
      .acb-columns-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 280px; }
      .acb-two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
      .acb-own-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .acb-nav-links { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav class="acb-nav">
    <div class="acb-wordmark">AGORA <span>·</span> COMMUNITY BROADCASTING</div>
    <div class="acb-nav-links">
      <a href="#">Watch</a>
      <a href="#">Broadcast</a>
      <a href="#">Own a Channel</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="acb-hero">
    <div class="acb-eyebrow">Faith · Community · Education</div>
    <h1 class="acb-hero-headline">Where Every Voice Finds the Public Square</h1>
    <p class="acb-hero-sub">Three live channels carrying the voices of faith communities, local organizations, and schools — broadcast to the world, free to watch.</p>
    <div class="acb-cta-row">
      <a href="#" class="acb-btn-primary">Watch Live</a>
      <a href="#" class="acb-btn-secondary">Broadcast with Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="acb-columns-section">
    <div class="acb-columns-label">Live Channels</div>
    <div class="acb-columns-grid">

      <div class="acb-column-card">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 140 64" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <rect x="18" y="48" width="10" height="16" fill="rgba(196,120,42,0.25)"/>
          <rect x="112" y="48" width="10" height="16" fill="rgba(196,120,42,0.25)"/>
          <path d="M18 48 Q70 0 122 48" fill="none" stroke="#C4782A" stroke-width="1"/>
          <line x1="8" y1="48" x2="132" y2="48" stroke="rgba(232,213,176,0.2)" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="acb-column-body">
          <div class="acb-column-name">Faith</div>
          <div class="acb-column-desc">Worship, teaching &amp; ministry</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="acb-column-card" style="border-color: rgba(196,120,42,0.4);">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 140 64" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <rect x="18" y="48" width="10" height="16" fill="rgba(196,120,42,0.4)"/>
          <rect x="112" y="48" width="10" height="16" fill="rgba(196,120,42,0.4)"/>
          <path d="M18 48 Q70 0 122 48" fill="none" stroke="#C4782A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="8" y1="48" x2="132" y2="48" stroke="rgba(232,213,176,0.3)" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="acb-column-body">
          <div class="acb-column-name">Community</div>
          <div class="acb-column-desc">Local voices, civic life &amp; sports</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="acb-column-card">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 140 64" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <rect x="18" y="48" width="10" height="16" fill="rgba(196,120,42,0.25)"/>
          <rect x="112" y="48" width="10" height="16" fill="rgba(196,120,42,0.25)"/>
          <path d="M18 48 Q70 0 122 48" fill="none" stroke="#C4782A" stroke-width="1"/>
          <line x1="8" y1="48" x2="132" y2="48" stroke="rgba(232,213,176,0.2)" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="acb-column-body">
          <div class="acb-column-name">Education</div>
          <div class="acb-column-desc">Schools, students &amp; learning</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center; margin-top: 1.25rem;">
      <span class="acb-live-dot"></span>
      <span class="acb-live-label">Broadcasting 24/7</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="acb-divider">

  <section class="acb-two-col">
    <div>
      <div class="acb-section-eyebrow">For Organizations &amp; Individuals</div>
      <h2 class="acb-section-headline">Your Story Belongs in the Square</h2>
      <p class="acb-section-body">No local channel? No problem. Churches, schools, community groups, and individuals can broadcast events, services, and stories through the appropriate Agora channel — reaching audiences without building infrastructure from scratch.</p>
      <a href="#" class="acb-btn-primary" style="font-size:12px; padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;">Learn how it works ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="acb-quote">
        "The agora was the beating heart of Greek civic life — a place where commerce, justice, worship, and conversation all occupied the same ground."
        <div class="acb-quote-attr">— The Oxford Classical Dictionary</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="acb-divider">

  <section class="acb-own-section">
    <div class="acb-own-card">
      <div class="acb-own-tag">Coming Soon</div>
      <h2 class="acb-own-headline">Ready for Your Own Agora?</h2>
      <p class="acb-own-body">When you're ready to move beyond shared channels, own your broadcast home. Your brand, your schedule, your audience — powered by the same infrastructure that runs the Agora network.</p>
      <div class="acb-own-grid">
        <div class="acb-own-option">
          <div class="acb-own-option-label">For Organizations</div>
          <div class="acb-own-option-desc">Schools, churches, and nonprofits get a fully branded channel with dedicated airtime and sponsorship control.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="acb-own-option">
          <div class="acb-own-option-label">For Individuals</div>
          <div class="acb-own-option-desc">Creators, pastors, coaches, and community leaders launch their own live presence under their own name.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="#" class="acb-btn-secondary" style="font-size:12px; padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;">Get notified when it launches ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="acb-divider">

  <section class="acb-pp-section">
    <div class="acb-pp-bar">
      <div class="acb-pp-left">
        <div class="acb-pp-icon">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="2" y="2" width="6" height="6" rx="1" fill="#C4782A" opacity="0.8"/>
            <rect x="10" y="2" width="6" height="6" rx="1" fill="#C4782A" opacity="0.5"/>
            <rect x="2" y="10" width="6" height="6" rx="1" fill="#C4782A" opacity="0.5"/>
            <rect x="10" y="10" width="6" height="6" rx="1" fill="#C4782A" opacity="0.3"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="acb-pp-label">Powered by</div>
          <div class="acb-pp-name">Peak Platforms</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="acb-pp-desc">
        Agora Community Broadcasting is a Peak Platforms network — purpose-built platforms for mission-driven people.
      </div>
      <a href="https://peak-platforms.com" class="acb-pp-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">peak-platforms.com ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="acb-footer">
    <div class="acb-footer-wordmark">AGORA COMMUNITY BROADCASTING</div>
    <div class="acb-footer-sub">agoracommunitybroadcasting.com</div>
    <div class="acb-footer-pp">A Peak Platforms Network</div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
